  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Conserving angular momentum w.r.t centre of earth,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>mV</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br />Conserving mechanical energy of the system,<br /><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></math><br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>64</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8000</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>"
